      "message_parsed": "Идея может быть не нова. Ну не знаю, мне вот так захотелось. Выкладываю, если посчитаете чушью, сильно не пинать.<br />\n#Author: dimka3210<br />\n#Time install: 3 min.<br />\nв <b>main.css </b><br />\n<pre class=\"xfBb-code\" data-lang=\"\">img.expando{\nborder: none;\nvertical-align: bottom;\nmax-width: 70%;\nmax-height: 70%;\n}</pre><b>page_header.tpl </b><br />\n<pre class=\"xfBb-code\" data-lang=\"html\">&lt;script type=&quot;text/javascript&quot; src=&quot;{#BB_ROOT}misc/js/img_dimka3210.js&quot;&gt;&lt;/script&gt;</pre><b>posting_editor.tpl </b><br />\nнайти bbcode.addTag(&quot;codeCode&quot;, &quot;code&quot;, null, &quot;K&quot;, ctrl);<br />\nдобавить<br />\n<pre class=\"xfBb-code\" data-lang=\"php\">bbcode.addTag(&quot;codesrc&quot;, &quot;src&quot;, null, &quot;&quot;, ctrl);</pre>в удобное место<br />\n<pre class=\"xfBb-code\" data-lang=\"php\">&lt;input type=&quot;button&quot; value=&quot;src&quot; name=&quot;codesrc&quot; title=&quot;SRC&quot; style=&quot;width: 40px;&quot; /&gt;</pre><b>bbcode.php </b><br />\nнайти $bbcode_tpl[&#039;img_aligned&#039;] = &lt;&lt;&lt;HTML<br />\n&lt;var class=&quot;postImg postImgAligned img-\\\\1&quot; title=&quot;\\\\2&quot;&gt;&amp;#10;&lt;/var&gt;<br />\nHTML;<br />\nниже добавить<br />\n<pre class=\"xfBb-code\" data-lang=\"php\">// SRC\n$bbcode_tpl[&#039;src_open&#039;] = &lt;&lt;&lt;HTML\n    &lt;img class=&quot;expando&quot; border=&quot;0&quot; src=&quot;\nHTML;\n$bbcode_tpl[&#039;src_close&#039;] = &lt;&lt;&lt;HTML\n    &quot; height=&quot;100&quot; /&gt;\nHTML;</pre>найти &quot;#\\[img\\]($img_url_exp)\\[/img\\]#isu&quot; =&gt; $tpl[&#039;img&#039;],<br />\nниже добавить<br />\n<pre class=\"xfBb-code\" data-lang=\"php\">&quot;#\\[src\\]isu#&quot;                                            =&gt; $tpl[&#039;src_open&#039;],\n            &quot;#\\[\\/src\\]isu#&quot;                                        =&gt; $tpl[&#039;src_close&#039;],</pre>найти &#039;[clear]&#039; =&gt; &#039;&lt;div class=&quot;clear&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;&#039;,<br />\nниже добавить<br />\n<pre class=\"xfBb-code\" data-lang=\"php\">&#039;[src]&#039;        =&gt; $tpl[&#039;src_open&#039;],\n            &#039;[/src]&#039;    =&gt; $tpl[&#039;src_close&#039;],</pre>файл img_dimka3210.js положить в <b>misc/js</b><br />\nРезультат<br />\n<div data-template-name=\"public:_media_site_embed_youtube\" class=\"bbMediaWrapper\" data-media-site-id=\"youtube\" data-media-key=\"YCYs88VJ_f0\">\n\t<div class=\"bbMediaWrapper-inner\">\n\t\t<iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/YCYs88VJ_f0?wmode=opaque\"\n\t\t\t\tloading=\"lazy\"\n\t\t\t\twidth=\"560\" height=\"315\"\n\t\t\t\tframeborder=\"0\" allowfullscreen=\"true\"></iframe>\n\t</div>\n</div><br />\n﻿",
